1
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,560
Among those in town with a Yanbei accent...

2
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:02,960
there's one other person.

3
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,640
It's her fellow townsman.

4
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,879
Her fellow townsman?

5
00:01:06,599 --> 00:01:07,159
Who is it?

6
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,159
It's...

7
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,359
Master

8
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,400
Master

9
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:29,040
Why can't I move?

10
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,400
Paper seller

11
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,480
It's you?

12
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,480
Paper seller

13
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,439
Why is it you again?

14
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,879
You two. You two.

15
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:53,799
Buy a newspaper?

16
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:55,840
The ancient book, Heavenly Craftsmanship,

17
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,519
hand it over to me,

18
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:59,519
and I'll spare your life.

19
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,480
Don't bother looking for me.

20
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:08,159
I was just looking for you too.

21
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,360
You have a Yanbei accent.

22
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,599
You're the Spirit Medium's fellow townsman.

23
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,240
Jiang Huai.

24
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:23,319
Looking for Heavenly Craftsmanship?

25
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:26,039
Heavenly Craftsmanship...

26
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,840
How did it end up in your hands?

27
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,360
This book

28
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,400
is your family's ancestral heirloom.

29
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,520
But you had no idea

30
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,719
that it hides a massive secret.

31
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,719
It's a waste to leave it in your hands.

32
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,400
So I stole the book,

33
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,879
and set a fire

34
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,479
to burn down your family's library.

35
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,120
Run!

36
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,000
Huai'er!

37
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,479
Run!

38
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,199
Run!

39
00:02:58,919 --> 00:02:59,759
Run!

40
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,439
You set the fire!

41
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,280
You stole the book!

42
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,199
Tell me,

43
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,639
why did you burn our Wenchang Pavilion?

44
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,800
Heavenly Craftsmanship

45
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:21,000
is useless in your hands.

46
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,439
Treasures must be put to good use.

47
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:29,479
We were both the Warlord's servants then.

48
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:32,159
Before he died, the Warlord gave an order.

49
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:35,360
Amidst the warlord conflicts,

50
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:39,840
my Yanbei Army's forces were depleted.

51
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,759
If we want to make a comeback,

52
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,639
we must raise funds for the army.

53
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,080
Yes.

54
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,879
How should we raise the funds?

55
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,360
Please instruct us, Warlord.

56
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:57,199
A prince from the late Qing dynasty

57
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,319
and I are old acquaintances.

58
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,639
He said

59
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:04,039
his ancestors wrote a vault's location

60
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:08,039
in the book Heavenly Craftsmanship.

61
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,960
Heavenly Craftsmanship?

62
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,360
Where is this book now?

63
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:14,000
This book

64
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:17,319
is in the library at Wenchang Pavilion.

65
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,560
You must find this book

66
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:25,360
and revitalize the Yanbei Army.

67
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:27,079
Warlord! Warlord!

68
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,360
Warlord! Warlord!

69
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,639
After the Warlord passed away,

70
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:35,839
we set the fire and stole the book,

71
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,600
heading south with Heavenly Craftsmanship.

72
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,600
But unexpectedly,

73
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,800
while the two of us were resting,

74
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,720
the book was stolen by thieves.

75
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,560
Later, we found out

76
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,000
it was the Four Thieves of Yanbei.

77
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,399
Hurry!

78
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,920
Eventually, the book ended up in Li Town,

79
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,600
in the hands of Master Li.

80
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,360
So,

81
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:01,160
we came to Li Town.

82
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:05,120
The Spirit Medium searched the Li Estate.

83
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,439
I searched the whole estate to no avail.

84
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,319
However,

85
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,639
I unexpectedly discovered

86
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,839
Chunmei, Dazhu, and Erzhu plotting.

87
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:17,720
They wanted to kill Master Li.

88
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,480
Since the book wasn't found,

89
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:21,759
Master Li couldn't die.

90
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,879
We had to find a way

91
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,480
to keep him alive.

92
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,879
Your plan was going smoothly at first.

93
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:38,079
But after we arrived in Li Town,

94
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,600
I was caught for a ghost marriage.

95
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,959
Brother Xun reported it,

96
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,800
and Mu Ying investigated.

97
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,120
The haunting case at the Li Estate

98
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,360
was about to be solved.

99
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,800
Seeing that you were

100
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,720
about to be caught in one swoop,

101
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,800
you feared Master Li would expose you.

102
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,920
So you ordered the Spirit Medium

103
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,639
to use the poison on the bracelet

104
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,079
to poison Master Li.

105
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,560
You feared the poison would be detected,

106
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:14,879
and trace the bracelet

107
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,360
back to the Spirit Medium,

108
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:20,279
so you snuck into the hospital with her

109
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,160
to steal the evidence.

110
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:11,800
The corpse has risen!

111
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:14,319
Master Li has risen from the dead!

112
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,240
The Spirit Medium disguised as Master Li,

113
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:35,240
successfully tricking Xun away.

114
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:38,000
Then you snuck in and attacked the doctor,

115
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:40,519
stealing the lab report and the bracelet.

116
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:43,279
To destroy the evidence,

117
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:46,839
you even brought Master Li's body

118
00:07:47,879 --> 00:07:50,079
to burn at the gates of the Li Estate.

119
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,439
And then,

120
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,800
to end this once and for all,

121
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:11,480
you decided to poison the Spirit Medium.

122
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,600
We owe the Warlord everything.

123
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:16,639
The treasure must not fall to others.

124
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,480
After Master Li died,

125
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,920
the police will soon track us down.

126
00:08:20,199 --> 00:08:22,079
Let's grab the book and get out of here.

127
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:22,759
Not so fast.

128
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,759
If we leave now,

129
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:25,600
Mu Ying will have her eyes on us.

130
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,240
We have to wait for things to cool down,

131
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:29,480
then we'll find a way to leave Li Town.

132
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:33,279
Our old fortune-telling scams

133
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,600
were all exposed by them.

134
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,039
We need a new trick from now on.

135
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:38,360
Let's use Spirit Summoning with Rice.

136
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,000
You know too much.

137
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,399
Only I can guard the treasure.

138
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,000
You used ink laced with aconitine

139
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:49,120
to print the newspaper.

140
00:08:50,279 --> 00:08:51,399
Once the finger was cut,

141
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,600
the poison entered the bloodstream,

142
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:54,879
causing death.

143
00:08:55,879 --> 00:08:56,559
Old man,

144
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,840
I don't know who you are,

145
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,799
but to keep the treasure for yourself,

146
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,399
you'd even murder your own accomplice.

147
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,120
Are you even human?

148
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:24,200
Mu Ying!

149
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,279
What the hell did you do to Mu Ying?

150
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,200
I installed a timing device

151
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:32,639
on the poison gas valve.

152
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:35,120
It opens every half hour.

153
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,159
The gas will grow thicker each time...

154
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:40,080
...until Mu Ying dies.

155
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,679
Jiang Huai.

156
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:45,360
You have the time for one incense stick.

157
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,840
Find the vault's location in the book.

158
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,120
If you dare call the police,

159
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,600
I'll kill Mu Ying right away.

160
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,639
Mu Ying!
